{title: Naina}
{artist: Armaan Malik Sona Mahapatra}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
Naina nu [G]pata hai,        Naina di kha [D]ta hai
Sanu kis ga [G]l di phir,        Mildi sa [D]za hai
Nind ud ja [D]awe, chain chhad ja [Bm]awe,        Ishq di fa [Em]qiri jad lag [A]jaawe
Nind ud ja [D]awe, chain chhad ja [Bm]awe,        Ishq di fa [G]qiri jad lag [A]jaawe
[D]Aye mann karda ae thagi thoriya,        [Bm]Aye mann karda ae seena zoriyan
[G]Aine sikh laiyan dil diyan choriyaan,        [D]Aye mann diyaan ne kamzoriyaan
[D]Mann mann ki sunta jaaye,        [Bm]Sunta nahin mann waalon [G]ki
[D]Mann hi mann mein banaaye,        [Bm]Duniya ye ek khayaalon [G]ki..
[D]Paas koi aawe,door koi [Bm]jaawe,        Hota hai [Em]kyun yeh, koi sam [A]jhaawe
